# Scope lock (v0.1)

## IN

- Public repo input (URL or owner/repo)
- Timeline with exactly 4 event types: first commit, releases, top-contributor first commits, monthly activity spikes
- Supabase-cached results
- Graceful handling of huge/private/bad input and rate limits
- Shareable URL per repo (`/[owner]/[repo]`)
- Live deploy with HTTPS (shipping goal)

## OUT — park in docs/v2-ideas.md

- Auth / accounts / favorites
- Private repos
- AI-generated anything
- Multi-repo dashboards / comparisons
- Custom event types or filters beyond the 4
- Mobile-perfect polish (desktop-first; don't break mobile)

## Anti-abandon

1. "Ooh what if…" → `docs/v2-ideas.md`, not this sprint.
2. Timeline visual polish gets one dedicated day — then ship.
3. No auth "so we can save favorites."
